OL,3,GNEWSATwo men jailed for raping woman in
OL,4,Aunderground car park
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men have been jailed for raping a
OL,7,Fwoman in an underground car park in
OL,8,FCounty Tyrone.
OL,10,FLuis Dos Martins Mariano, 20, with an
OL,11,Faddress of Sloan Street, and Alcino
OL,12,FSoares, 21, with an address of
OL,13,FBraeside, also in Dungannon, both
OL,14,Fpreviously pleaded guilty to rape.
OL,16,FBoth men moved to Northern Ireland from
OL,17,FEast Timor when they were younger.
OL,19,FThe rape took place on 10 September
OL,20,F2023 when both men were 17 and some of
OL,21,Fit was recorded on CCTV. The victim was
OL,22,F19 at the time.
